{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 1, "text": "布依族文化大观", "bbox_px": {"x": 667, "y": 165, "w": 302, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族文化大观", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 667, "y": 165, "w": 302, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 2, "text": "条件下，他们不可能认识到事物运动变化的原因在于事物内部自身。因此，在布依族先", "bbox_px": {"x": 44, "y": 270, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "条件下，他们不可能认识到事物运动变化的原因在于事物内部自身。因此，在布依族先", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 44, "y": 270, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 3, "text": "民看来，只有字宙的原初物质是不够的，还需要努力发挥人的主观能动性，才能辅助宇宙", "bbox_px": {"x": 48, "y": 334, "w": 1548, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "民看来，只有字宙的原初物质是不够的，还需要努力发挥人的主观能动性，才能辅助宇宙", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 48, "y": 334, "w": 1548, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 4, "text": "万物得以产生。正如老子所言：“以辅万物之自然而不敢为。”①韩非子云：“恃万物之自", "bbox_px": {"x": 52, "y": 394, "w": 1544, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "万物得以产生。正如老子所言：“以辅万物之自然而不敢为。”①韩非子云：“恃万物之自", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 52, "y": 394, "w": 1544, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 5, "text": "然而不敢为也。”②不敢为是指不妄为，而不是无所作为。然而，布依族先民认为，能够辅", "bbox_px": {"x": 52, "y": 463, "w": 1548, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "然而不敢为也。”②不敢为是指不妄为，而不是无所作为。然而，布依族先民认为，能够辅", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 52, "y": 463, "w": 1548, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 6, "text": "助宇宙而使万物得以产生者，并非一般人，而是具有特殊能力之神人—布杰公。", "bbox_px": {"x": 52, "y": 531, "w": 1419, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "助宇宙而使万物得以产生者，并非一般人，而是具有特殊能力之神人—布杰公。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 52, "y": 531, "w": 1419, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 7, "text": "《开天辟地》说：", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 599, "w": 277, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "《开天辟地》说：", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 599, "w": 277, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 8, "text": "天地分开了，", "bbox_px": {"x": 382, "y": 672, "w": 221, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "天地分开了，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 382, "y": 672, "w": 221, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
