{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 25, "text": "捏成圆太阳。③", "bbox_px": {"x": 848, "y": 1182, "w": 266, "h": 58}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "捏成圆太阳。③", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 848, "y": 1182, "w": 266, "h": 58}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 26, "text": "布杰祖先造出十二个太阳坯子，可是“不亮又不烫”。他在神的启示下架柴烤了九", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 1247, "w": 1467, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布杰祖先造出十二个太阳坯子，可是“不亮又不烫”。他在神的启示下架柴烤了九", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 1247, "w": 1467, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 27, "text": "夜，又用犀牛毛擦了九天，终于把太阳擦亮了。布杰乘风上到天庭，用牙齿当钉把十二个", "bbox_px": {"x": 52, "y": 1316, "w": 1552, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "夜，又用犀牛毛擦了九天，终于把太阳擦亮了。布杰乘风上到天庭，用牙齿当钉把十二个", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 52, "y": 1316, "w": 1552, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 28, "text": "太阳钉在了天上，安排它们：", "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1384, "w": 494, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "太阳钉在了天上，安排它们：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1384, "w": 494, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 29, "text": "一个照天庭，", "bbox_px": {"x": 378, "y": 1452, "w": 233, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "一个照天庭，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 378, "y": 1452, "w": 233, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 30, "text": "仙女好洗衣。", "bbox_px": {"x": 382, "y": 1516, "w": 230, "h": 50}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "仙女好洗衣。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 382, "y": 1516, "w": 230, "h": 50}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 31, "text": "一个照山川，", "bbox_px": {"x": 376, "y": 1570, "w": 238, "h": 65}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "一个照山川，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 376, "y": 1570, "w": 238, "h": 65}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 32, "text": "山川就秀丽。", "bbox_px": {"x": 386, "y": 1645, "w": 229, "h": 50}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "山川就秀丽。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 386, "y": 1645, "w": 229, "h": 50}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 33, "text": "一天一个都从东方起，", "bbox_px": {"x": 378, "y": 1714, "w": 398, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "一天一个都从东方起，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 378, "y": 1714, "w": 398, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 34, "text": "再从西方落。", "bbox_px": {"x": 382, "y": 1777, "w": 234, "h": 51}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "再从西方落。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 382, "y": 1777, "w": 234, "h": 51}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 35, "text": "布杰公是布依族先民在社会生产力水平极低的条件下，幻想出来的人类征服自然的", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1839, "w": 1467, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布杰公是布依族先民在社会生产力水平极低的条件下，幻想出来的人类征服自然的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1839, "w": 1467, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 36, "text": "代表，因此，与其说布杰公是神，不如说其是人。从哲学上说，神有二义，一是不可测，此", "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1907, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "代表，因此，与其说布杰公是神，不如说其是人。从哲学上说，神有二义，一是不可测，此", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 56, "y": 1907, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 37, "text": "即《易•系辞传》所谓：“阴阳不测之谓神。”二是指事物将来的要素，是事物完全的典型，", "bbox_px": {"x": 60, "y": 1963, "w": 1548, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "即《易•系辞传》所谓：“阴阳不测之谓神。”二是指事物将来的要素，是事物完全的典型，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 60, "y": 1963, "w": 1548, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 38, "text": "即事物之所以为事物者，亦即事物之理，例如“神口”、“神来之笔”等。冯友兰先生在论及", "bbox_px": {"x": 60, "y": 2019, "w": 1549, "h": 78}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "即事物之所以为事物者，亦即事物之理，例如“神口”、“神来之笔”等。冯友兰先生在论及", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 60, "y": 2019, "w": 1549, "h": 78}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 39, "text": "神的含义时说：“一般人虽已将理作实际的个体而想象之，但若不以之为已有，则仍觉它", "bbox_px": {"x": 60, "y": 2096, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "神的含义时说：“一般人虽已将理作实际的个体而想象之，但若不以之为已有，则仍觉它", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 60, "y": 2096, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 104, "line_no": 40, "text": "是空的。必须在实际中已有完全合乎其理之事物，一般人方觉有所抓着而不致于落空。", "bbox_px": {"x": 60, "y": 2165, "w": 1556, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "是空的。必须在实际中已有完全合乎其理之事物，一般人方觉有所抓着而不致于落空。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 60, "y": 2165, "w": 1556, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
